  description: 'In battle, you fight with primal ferocity. On your turn, you can enter a rage as a bonus action. REAL/WORKING activation loop: costs a bonus action plus one use of resource-rage-uses (long-rest recovery) and applies condition-raging to yourself for 10 rounds (~1 minute). See condition-raging for which of Rage''s numeric benefits are still pending an engine hook.'
